---
description: Claude Code Game Studios rules for Cursor agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Coding agents in this repository may be Cursor agents rather than Claude Code. These rules apply either way.

- Follow `CLAUDE.md` at the repository root, and every folder `CLAUDE.md`, as the project rules.
- Treat each `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` as the procedure for the slash command of the same name. For example, `/prototype` means follow `.claude/skills/prototype/SKILL.md`.
- When the harness does not run the hooks, run those hooks' checks by hand.
- Treat `.claude/agents` as roles to play.
